<title>BELGIUM: Economic forecast for European Union.</title>
<headline>Economic forecast for European Union.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for the 15-nation European Union:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 1.6	  2.3</p>
<p> Investment			 3.8	  5.0</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.6	  2.2</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    10.9	 10.8</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  4.4	  3.0</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)  Debt/GDP ratio		  73.5	 73.7</p>
</text>
